 {
  "id": "SCENARIO/305/0145c",
  "speaker": null,
  "jp": [
   "今日は、＜翼ある者の年齢＞に",
   "ついて話をしましょう"
  ],
  "en": "Today, let us speak of the Age of the Winged Ones."
